es (i) through (v), such Effects shall be taken into account in determining whether a “Company Material Adverse Effect” has occurred or would reasonably be expected to occur, to the extent that such Effect has had a disproportionate adverse effect on the Company relative to other companies in the same industry. (Pages 12-13)\nAnswer:
